<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "published": true,
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-07-11T02:47:21.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 22366,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "Keys to the Register",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "[SAM]:  Okay, I'll admit it — it's getting good at this. It talked someone from mango sorbet into double chocolate like a pro.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-e0a9bcf5-aa9e-443d-a879-725e04f602e9",
        "typing": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": false
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: But here's my situation. It TALKS to customers all day... and then I still have to punch every order into the register myself. My hands are freezing and I'm behind.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-0c3cc5e2-306f-4680-a231-81a4c98f04fd",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: See, the menu board says what we SELL. The freezer says what we HAVE RIGHT NOW. Those are two different questions.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-5ea2ca70-9731-48d5-8da0-199f0863e0d3",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: So. Big step. I'm letting it use the register.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-8823d531-5f2b-49fe-b76e-6f7a4c0a5204",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: But listen — this tool is different. The others just LOOK things up. This one COMMITS. A real order. If it rings up a sundae we can't make, that's a real angry customer.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-7b46e7f5-ca1e-4332-a4c3-fba6bd9b9c34",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: So think hard about the ORDER things happen in. What should it check before it ever touches that register?",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "thescoop-panels-level3-2583124b-14f4-4268-9da5-37f933b77a30",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": false
      },
      {
        "text": "# 🔓 TOOL UNLOCKED: Take Order\n\nCommits a real order. Use with care.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-fee4b686-0582-462c-9774-c2f0ced0f100",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      }
    ],
    "use_links": "false"
  },
